# 0.2.8: mobile data and LTE (zcell, rild-lite in zboot/tools, the modem driver
# with zero-copy), the new Updates app, Wi-Fi recovery after sleep, the heat
# guard. KERNEL_FILES is cumulative (see 0.2.3.env): 0.2.7's + zrn-modem.ko.
# Built with 0.2.7's kernel options (kernel/beyondx/ci-build.env): the phones
# keep that BOOT, and the updater refuses modules for another kernel config.
KERNEL_FILES="usr/local/lib/zboot/tools/zrn-system-sleep-bx.ko usr/local/lib/zboot/tools/snd-zrn-abox-bx.ko usr/local/lib/zboot/tools/zrn-s6sy761.ko usr/lib/modules/7.1.0-zboot/extra/brcmfmac.ko usr/lib/modules/7.1.0-zboot/extra/pcie-exynos9820.ko usr/local/lib/zboot/zrn-modem.ko"
